# A 390×844 phone at DPR 3 by touch: the title, Practice, the round (the
# score-only HUD, the tray), a piece and a cell tapped, the info drawer, the
# pause panel.
# viewport 390x844@3
until 300 Play
frames 30
save phone-title
touch =Practice
until 60 Free play with undo
frames 10
touch =Start
until 120 Hint
frames 40
save phone-game
touch Select
frames 10
touch =Row 5 column 5, empty
frames 20
expect occupied
touch =Open info panel
until 30 Objective
frames 10
save phone-drawer
touch =Open info panel
frames 10
touch =Pause
until 60 =Resume
frames 10
save phone-paused
touch =Resume
frames 10
